#!/bin/bash
# =============================================================================================
#  ⚠️ DEPRECATED — login MITM proxy launcher (moved out of the active launch path).
#
#  darkan-3-undercut replaces this with the Undercut engine's in-process `TcpIn` network sniffer
#  (no network redirection needed — see launch/run-undercut.sh and CLAUDE.md → "Proxy Deprecation").
#
#  Kept ONLY so captures can still be regenerated until the engine sniffer's capture-export mode
#  produces the capture/<session>/ format consumed by the :tools framingRegression /
#  wireFormatVerify gates. To run it anyway (advanced/legacy), remove the guard below.
